\section{Anti-Gaming Statement}
% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

\begin{itemize}[nosep]
  \item No future-click leakage: all features are computed from temporally prior data only.
  \item All features used are available at serving time (no oracle features such as ground-truth labels or future click counts).
  \item The test sets (EB-NeRD and MIND) do not contain click labels; predictions are generated using the trained model without access to ground truth.
  \item Metrics are reported with and without the category-match feature (ablation) to isolate its contribution.
\end{itemize}


