\end{table}

On EB-NeRD, the re-ranker trades slightly lower novelty for substantially better accuracy. On MIND, the re-ranker actually \emph{increases} both novelty and coverage over the baseline, suggesting that category-aware features help surface less obvious but topically relevant articles.


